{"title": "Steel Watcher Arm", "pageid": 34768, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Steel_Watcher_Arm", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Steel_Watcher_Arm_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Steel_Watcher_Arm_Faded.png/300px-Steel_Watcher_Arm_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/e/eb/Steel_Watcher_Arm_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Steel Watcher Arm image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Steel_Watcher_Arm_Faded.png/300px-Steel_Watcher_Arm_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/eb/Steel_Watcher_Arm_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Steel Watcher Arm</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> item. Primarily used to craft the <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Engine_Crossbow\" title=\"Hellfire Engine Crossbow\">Hellfire Engine Crossbow</a>\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-20d7a2f9d3c7b78fEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-b23840aa867b3128END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">DEC_Foundry_Steel_Watcher_Part_Left_Arm_F_Dynamic</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DEC_Foundry_Steel_Watcher_Part_Left_Arm_F_Dynamic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DEC_Foundry_Steel_Watcher_Part_Left_Arm_F_Dynamic\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">57db18bf-89dc-4eb4-950a-2598f5a06595</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:57db18bf-89dc-4eb4-950a-2598f5a06595\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:57db18bf-89dc-4eb4-950a-2598f5a06595\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Found on a table in the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a> on the main floor next to the plaque labeled \"Steel Watcher Arm Unit\". <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-280&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-165</span>\n</p>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>One of three components used to craft the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Engine_Crossbow\" title=\"Hellfire Engine Crossbow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Hellfire_Engine_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Hellfire_Engine_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Hellfire_Engine_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Hellfire_Engine_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Hellfire_Engine_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Hellfire_Engine_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Hellfire_Engine_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Hellfire_Engine_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Hellfire_Engine_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Engine_Crossbow\" title=\"Hellfire Engine Crossbow\">Hellfire Engine Crossbow</a>, alongside the <a href=\"/wiki/Watcher_Crossbow_Blueprint\" title=\"Watcher Crossbow Blueprint\">Watcher Crossbow Blueprint</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Targeting_Module\" title=\"Targeting Module\">Targeting Module</a>.</li>\n<li>The plaque next to this item states \"The arm component wields the mighty <a href=\"/wiki/Watcher_Greatsword\" title=\"Watcher Greatsword\">Watcher Sword</a>, but is also fitted with a foldout <a href=\"/wiki/Watcher_Crossbow\" title=\"Watcher Crossbow\">Harpoon Bow</a> for ranged combat\".</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202129\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1540/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24279/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6311/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936148/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.285      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   49.285      1 -total\n 42.34%   20.866      5 Template:Icon_text\n 39.65%   19.543     18 Template:Trim\n 22.27%   10.974      2 Template:Uid\n 14.69%    7.240      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.15%    6.479      1 Template:RarityItem\n 12.13%    5.978      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.00%    5.914      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11.87%    5.848      2 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34768-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202129 and revision id 197062. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}